msgstr "a few days flip it"

#: templates/report.html.j2:426
msgid ""
"It states how sensitive the verdict is to <b>which meals happened to be recorded</b> "
"—\n"
"    not how likely the carb ratio is correct, and not a confidence interval for a "
"true value. A verdict\n"
"    that flips under resampling rests on a few individual meals; one that holds does "
"not become\n"
"    clinically right by that alone. The thresholds for high/moderate/low are "
"heuristic."
msgstr ""
"It states how sensitive the verdict is to <b>which meals happened to be recorded</b> "
"—\n"
