"about %(lo)s %% stays invisible to this method, from about %(hi)s %% it is flagged "
"reliably. Days matter mostly against false alarms — with five days a correctly set "
"slot is still flagged in roughly %(few)s %% of cases, with three weeks in about "
"%(many)s %%. A day count marked "
